{"3976990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DON'T LOOK AT GRANDMA", "steam_appid": 3976990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4135260], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/extras/d136f7ee6a02d93776c68cded0904343.poster.avif?t=1766178863\" aria-label=\"A slow, suspenseful pan through a mid-90s suburban dining and living room, steeped in darkness, ends on a boxy television set flickering with a regional weather forecast.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/extras/d136f7ee6a02d93776c68cded0904343.webm?t=1766178863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/extras/d136f7ee6a02d93776c68cded0904343.mp4?t=1766178863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Grandma has changed—and not for the better. Tonight, something ancient takes hold of her, twisting her into a vessel for the Devil itself. Before the darkness fully claims her, she leaves you one final warning: whatever you do… <strong>DON’T LOOK AT GRANDMA.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside, descend into Grandpa’s hidden chamber, and attempt the ritual that might save her soul—if you can make it through the night.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perform the Ritual</strong> – Search every shelf, drawer, closet, and cabinet for five sacred heirlooms needed to banish the Devil and save Grandma's soul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don’t Look at Grandma</strong> – The Devil only wins if you make eye contact, and Grandma has a way of appearing where you least expect her...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets Beneath the House</strong> – Discover the origins of a generational curse and uncover long-buried truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Horror</strong> – Each run reveals new ritual items and curses, daring you to face fresh challenges and surprises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light the flames. Gather the heirlooms. Face the Devil. Complete the ritual. <br>And whatever you do… <strong>DON’T LOOK AT GRANDMA. </strong> <br><br><i>Developer note:  Grandma's house is a loving recreation of my actual Grandma's house, circa 1996!</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/extras/d136f7ee6a02d93776c68cded0904343.poster.avif?t=1766178863\" aria-label=\"A slow, suspenseful pan through a mid-90s suburban dining and living room, steeped in darkness, ends on a boxy television set flickering with a regional weather forecast.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/extras/d136f7ee6a02d93776c68cded0904343.webm?t=1766178863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/extras/d136f7ee6a02d93776c68cded0904343.mp4?t=1766178863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Grandma has changed—and not for the better. Tonight, something ancient takes hold of her, twisting her into a vessel for the Devil itself. Before the darkness fully claims her, she leaves you one final warning: whatever you do… <strong>DON’T LOOK AT GRANDMA.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside, descend into Grandpa’s hidden chamber, and attempt the ritual that might save her soul—if you can make it through the night.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perform the Ritual</strong> – Search every shelf, drawer, closet, and cabinet for five sacred heirlooms needed to banish the Devil and save Grandma's soul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don’t Look at Grandma</strong> – The Devil only wins if you make eye contact, and Grandma has a way of appearing where you least expect her...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets Beneath the House</strong> – Discover the origins of a generational curse and uncover long-buried truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Horror</strong> – Each run reveals new ritual items and curses, daring you to face fresh challenges and surprises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light the flames. Gather the heirlooms. Face the Devil. Complete the ritual. <br>And whatever you do… <strong>DON’T LOOK AT GRANDMA. </strong> <br><br><i>Developer note:  Grandma's house is a loving recreation of my actual Grandma's house, circa 1996!</i></p>", "short_description": "Grandma hasn’t been the same since Grandpa passed. A night in her house spirals into a battle with the Devil. Recover family heirlooms and perform the ritual to save her soul. But whatever you do… DON’T LOOK AT GRANDMA.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/3418a29e01574449954ea5c22456f876946cf398/header.jpg?t=1766178863", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/1744877717309f6ea117e8d0192a6d642b1987d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766178863", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/1744877717309f6ea117e8d0192a6d642b1987d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766178863", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-7500 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or equivalen